WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.090 --> 00:00:01.010
- What I didn't expect,

00:00:01.010 --> 00:00:02.260
I thought I was gonna get all this love,

00:00:02.260 --> 00:00:04.010
people were gonna agree with me

00:00:04.010 --> 00:00:05.780
and instead I just got

00:00:05.780 --> 00:00:08.010
this unending torrent of hate online,

00:00:08.010 --> 00:00:09.060
which well about.

00:00:09.060 --> 00:00:10.850
And then one day I was at my barber,

00:00:10.850 --> 00:00:12.180
my friend Jess,

00:00:12.180 --> 00:00:13.340
and she called David over

00:00:13.340 --> 00:00:14.380
and she took out the mirror

00:00:14.380 --> 00:00:15.213
and she said,

00:00:15.213 --> 00:00:16.046
"You better look at this."

00:00:16.046 --> 00:00:18.920
And I had lost these
massive chunks of hair,

00:00:18.920 --> 00:00:20.230
literally to the point where,

00:00:20.230 --> 00:00:22.180
at one point it was about 40%,

00:00:22.180 --> 00:00:23.013
if not more.

00:00:23.013 --> 00:00:24.160
I was spraying on my hair,

00:00:24.160 --> 00:00:25.300
painting it on.

00:00:25.300 --> 00:00:26.810
That why I left the live video

00:00:26.810 --> 00:00:27.680
that I know you've seen,

00:00:27.680 --> 00:00:29.799
'cause we've done some
panels together about it,

00:00:29.799 --> 00:00:31.210
was in the midst of it

00:00:31.210 --> 00:00:33.010
when I was not only just spraying on hair,

00:00:33.010 --> 00:00:35.010
but I was on this experimental medication

00:00:35.010 --> 00:00:36.060
and I was broken out

00:00:36.060 --> 00:00:37.820
and my head was oozing.

00:00:37.820 --> 00:00:38.708
And I swear to you,

00:00:38.708 --> 00:00:40.760
it's not exaggeration,

00:00:40.760 --> 00:00:41.870
I was about to quit.

00:00:41.870 --> 00:00:45.374
I was literally like an
hour away from quitting.

00:00:45.374 --> 00:00:47.957
(upbeat music)

00:00:53.820 --> 00:00:55.950
- Ladies and gentlemen, it is me,

00:00:55.950 --> 00:00:56.930
Candace Owens,

00:00:56.930 --> 00:00:58.300
the Founder of The Blexit Movement

00:00:58.300 --> 00:01:00.090
and I am the thrilled that my friend,

00:01:00.090 --> 00:01:02.377
Dave Rubin's book is finally out,

00:01:02.377 --> 00:01:03.520
