00:08:13.540 --> 00:08:15.510
I heard it and I wanted to introduce it

00:08:15.510 --> 00:08:17.060
and to debate it and to hear what you said

00:08:17.060 --> 00:08:18.760
and then you hit me back and you said,

00:08:18.760 --> 00:08:19.950
well then you said,

00:08:19.950 --> 00:08:21.760
Oh well then you could
make that same argument

00:08:21.760 --> 00:08:23.060
