00:08:23.060 --> 00:08:24.260
when women get rights.

00:08:24.260 --> 00:08:25.093
Right?

00:08:25.093 --> 00:08:26.610
And I said that's actually a
brilliant rebuttal to that.

00:08:26.610 --> 00:08:28.780
So I'm trying to learn
and build and part of that

00:08:28.780 --> 00:08:30.510
